config ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_AXIS_TAP
    bool "Axis-tap input processor"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_AXIS_TAP_ENABLED
    help
      Converts relative pointing-device motion into discrete taps of a set of
      behaviours (for example arrow keys), one tap per accumulated threshold on
      the dominant axis. Pair with a zmk,input-listener layer override to get
      cursor-key behaviour from a trackball while a layer is held.
